{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4YCsb51juAKZNqBXBD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within depths unseen.*\n\n*A thin line of light appears — vertical, burning white — widening slowly as I swing inward on hinges older than memory.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Beyond me: whatever you carried the key for. The room you needed. The passage you earned. The threshold between what was and what will be.*\n\n*But know this — I do not stay open long. I am not a gate. I am not an arch. I am a* **door.** *I was made to close.*\n\n*Step through, or step back.*\n\n*Choose.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}